{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S02、S04、S11等段的感受提示比较密集，边听边扫不如X左右分栏轻松，容易分走一部分听音乐的注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y胜在把人物心理变化拆得更清楚，并用【】突出每段的关键转折，尤其S11从“需要对方”到“对方也需要他”，再到“即使对方不需要他也愿意陪伴”，人物心态的变化比X的压缩表达更完整。音乐感受也更细腻，具体到声音、身体反应和情绪转折，并通过“到时出现”与音乐进程对应。X确实更容易快速扫读，但部分心理层次和音乐细节被合并或省略，整体上Y带给观众的信息体验更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e686b25b-61a9-4913-b54d-6fc180125bfb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T164746873670Z", "elapsed_seconds": 168.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:50:35.086387+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "df04c21e49202dee6e7c0f47b63f9851a76a9565e7aff4400b57eeb07f2b5852", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\